td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 5 Years</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>23-27.5 kg / 50.7-60.6 lbs</td>\n<td>116-125 cm / 45.7-49.2 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 6-7 Years</td>\n<td>6-7</td>\n<td>27.5-32.5 kg / 60.6-71.7 lbs</td>\n<td>126-140 cm / 49.6-55.1 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 9-10 Years</td>\n<td>9-10</td>\n<td>32.5-42.5 kg / 71.7-93.7 lbs</td>\n<td>140-155 cm / 55.1-61.0 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mother M</td>\n<td></td>\n<td>45-49.5 kg / 99.2-109.1 lbs</td>\n<td>152-160 cm / 59.8-63.0 in</td>\n<td>70ABC-75AB</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>Under 66.7 cm / Under 26.2 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mother L</td>\n<td></td>\n<td>50-57.5 kg / 110.2-126.8 lbs</td>\n<td>160-165 cm / 63.0-65.0 in</td>\n<td>75ABC-80AB</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>70.0-73.3 cm / 27.6-28.9 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mother XL</td>\n<td></td>\n<td>58-62.5 kg / 127.9-137.8 lbs</td>\n<td>165-170 cm / 65.0-66.9 in</td>\n<td>75ABC-80BC</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>76.7-80.0 cm / 30.2-31.5 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mother 2XL</td>\n<td></td>\n<td>63-72.5 kg / 138.9-159.8 lbs</td>\n<td>165-170 cm / 65.0-66.9 in</td>\n<td>80ABC-85AB</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>83.3-86.7 cm / 32.8-34.1 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mother 3XL</td>\n<td></td>\n<td>73-82.5 kg / 160.9-181.9 lbs</td>\n<td>165-175 cm / 65.0-68.9 in</td>\n<td>85BC-90BC</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>90.0-93.3 cm / 35.4-36.7 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mother 4XL</td>\n<td></td>\n<td>83-97.5 kg / 183.0-214.9 lbs</td>\n<td>165-175 cm / 65.0-68.9 in</td>\n<td>85BCD-95ABC</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>96.7-103.3 cm / 38.1-40.7 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n</tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p>The Blush Garden Mommy and Me Swimsuits bring a soft vacation palette to a pool-ready silhouette. Tiny coral florals, rose-pink ruffle trim, and the skirted one-piece cut make the set feel sweet and photo-ready without losing the practical ease you want for swim days.</p>\n\n<p>Each suit keeps the coverage-friendly look of a little swim dress while the attached bottoms stay ready for splashing, swimming, and chasing little ones around the pool. It is an easy mom-and-mini match for beach trips, resort mornings, backyard water play, and family travel photos.</p>\n\n<h3>Key Features:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Skirted swim-dress shape:</strong> One-piece construction keeps the look polished while the flared hem feels playful and easy.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Ruffle neckline detail:</strong> The rose-trimmed ruffle frames the shoulders for a sweet statement in both sizes.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Attached bottoms:</strong> The close-fitting inner brief keeps coverage secure for swimming, wading, and water play.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft floral palette:</strong> White ground plus blush-and-coral blooms style beautifully with straw bags, sandals, and beach coverups.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Inclusive mom sizing:</strong> Mother sizes run from M through 4XL alongside the matching girls size set.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>Choose the sizes you need and pack a matching swim look that feels ready for beach days, poolside photos, and every sunny family memory.</p>","tags":["Attached Bottoms","Beach","Blush","Child 2-3yr","Child 4-5yr","Child 6-8yr","Child 9-10yr","Floral","Girl Swimsuit","https://detail.1688.com/offer/1039451116404.html","Matching Family Swimwear","Matching Swimwear","Mom Size 2XL","Mom Size 3XL","Mom Size 4XL","Mom Size L","Mom Size M","Mom Size XL","Mommy and Me","Mother Swimsuit","One-Piece Swimsuit","Pink","Pool","Resort","Rose Trim","Ruffle","Ruffle Swim Dress","Summer","Swim Dress","Swim Dresses","Swimsuits","Vacation","White"],"seo":{"title":